{
  "$comment": "How each test file is bundled. Generated from the 547 one-off npm scripts this replaced: every flag set here is byte-identical to what that test built with before. A test file inherits the nearest enclosing directory default; overrides name the exceptions.",
  "$serialComment": "Tests that must not share a CPU with the rest: they assert on scheduler timing, so contention makes them flake. They run last, one at a time.",
